# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF
# while Prettier and `forge fmt` both expect LF, so `pnpm format:check` reports
# every file as misformatted even when nothing changed. Pinning eol=lf keeps the
# checkout identical on Linux, macOS and Windows.
#
# Every blob currently stored in the repository is already LF, so this changes
# no committed content.
* text=auto eol=lf
